  {
    "id": "b570634",
    "elType": "widget",
    "widgetType": "text-editor",
    "title": "Blocked Drain Local Story - Kitchen Drain Backing Up Near Heather Park, George",
    "path": "4>26c91ca>5581a32",
    "texts": [
      [
        "editor",
        "<h4>Kitchen Drain Backing Up Near Heather Park, George</h4><p>A kitchen drain in a Heather Park-style residential setting can start backing up when grease, food waste and soap residue collect beyond the trap. In a case like this, the first step is to check whether the blockage is limited to the kitchen run or whether other fixtures are affected. Once the line is opened, the team can clear the build-up carefully, test the flow and explain what should be kept out of the sink to reduce repeat blockages.</p>"
      ],
      [
        "text_color",
        "#000000"
      ],
      [
        "_title",
        "Blocked Drain Local Story - Kitchen Drain Backing Up Near Heather Park, George"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "050dd12",
    "elType": "widget",
    "widgetType": "text-editor",
    "title": "Blocked Drain Local Story - Outside Gully Overflow Around Diaz Beach, Mossel Bay",
    "path": "4>26c91ca>5581a32",
    "texts": [
      [
        "editor",
        "<h4>Outside Gully Overflow Around Diaz Beach, Mossel Bay</h4><p>Coastal homes and holiday properties around Diaz Beach and nearby Mossel Bay areas often deal with sand, garden debris and heavy usage during busy periods. When an outside gully overflows, the problem may be in the branch line or further down the drain. H2O Plumbers would check the affected gully, look for signs of surcharge, clear the obstruction where accessible and confirm whether the flow returns before the area is left safe and tidy.</p>"
      ],
      [
        "text_color",
        "#000000"
      ],
      [
        "_title",
        "Blocked Drain Local Story - Outside Gully Overflow Around Diaz Beach, Mossel Bay"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "bcd0631",
    "elType": "widget",
    "widgetType": "text-editor",
    "title": "Blocked Drain Local Story - Guesthouse Bathroom Drain Trouble Close to Knysna Central",
    "path": "4>26c91ca>5581a32",
    "texts": [
      [
        "editor",
        "<h4>Guesthouse Bathroom Drain Trouble Close to Knysna Central</h4><p>A guesthouse or short-stay property near Knysna Central cannot afford slow showers or bathroom odours. A drain issue in that setting needs careful handling because guests, housekeeping and property managers all need clear communication. The practical approach is to isolate the affected bathroom, check whether the blockage is local or shared, clear the line with the right method and give the manager simple notes on what was found.</p>"
      ],
      [
        "text_color",
        "#000000"
      ],
      [
        "_title",
        "Blocked Drain Local Story - Guesthouse Bathroom Drain Trouble Close to Knysna Central"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "a5aadff",
    "elType": "widget",
    "widgetType": "text-editor",
    "title": "Blocked Drain Local Story - Repeat Toilet Blockage in an Oudtshoorn Family Home",
    "path": "4>26c91ca>5581a32",
    "texts": [
      [
        "editor",
        "<h4>Repeat Toilet Blockage in an Oudtshoorn Family Home</h4><p>When a toilet in an Oudtshoorn home blocks repeatedly, the cause may be more than paper sitting in the pan. The line may have a partial obstruction, poor flow, root entry or a deeper drain issue. A useful callout would look at the pattern, check nearby fixtures, clear the immediate blockage and advise whether further inspection or pipe repair should be considered if the same problem returns.</p>"
      ],
      [
        "text_color",
        "#000000"
      ],
      [
        "_title",
        "Blocked Drain Local Story - Repeat Toilet Blockage in an Oudtshoorn Family Home"
      ]
    ]
  },
