    "path": "6>a1fe463",
    "texts": [
      [
        "editor",
        "<p>H2O Plumbers can assist with blocked drains on private property, including sinks, toilets, showers, gullies, inspection chambers and drainage lines linked to the property. If the issue appears to sit in a municipal sewer line, it may also need to be reported through the correct local channel. George Municipality lists water, sewer and sanitation contact details on its <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline;\"><a style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://www.george.gov.za/civil-engineering/water/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Water and Sanitation page</a></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">. </span>For property-side faults, H2O Plumbers can help check the symptoms and advise on the next practical step.</p>"
      ],
      [
        "text_color",
        "#FFFFFF"
      ],
      [
        "_title",
