      [
        "_title",
        "item #1"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "77c725d",
    "elType": "widget",
    "widgetType": "text-editor",
    "title": "",
    "path": "7>5379a55>9b703bb>07bf7ec",
    "texts": [
      [
        "editor",
        "<p>A drain that blocks again usually has a cause sitting deeper than the visible trap or toilet pan. Grease, soap residue, roots, debris, poor pipe fall or a damaged section can all create repeat trouble. Clearing the immediate blockage helps, but the pattern matters because it tells the plumber whether more investigation may be needed.</p>"
      ],
      [
        "text_color",
        "#545454"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "f670e8d",
    "elType": "container",
    "title": "item #2",
    "path": "7>5379a55>9b703bb",
    "texts": [
      [
        "_title",
        "item #2"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "52b33c5",
    "elType": "widget",
    "widgetType": "text-editor",
    "title": "",
    "path": "7>5379a55>9b703bb>f670e8d",
    "texts": [
      [
        "editor",
        "<p>Yes. An overflowing outside gully can mean the branch drain or main property line is not moving waste away properly. H2O Plumbers can check the affected area, clear the accessible blockage where possible and advise if the symptoms suggest a deeper line issue or possible municipal-side problem.</p>"
      ],
      [
        "text_color",
        "#545454"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "7828241",
    "elType": "container",
    "title": "item #3",
    "path": "7>5379a55>9b703bb",
    "texts": [
      [
        "_title",
        "item #3"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "4b3d608",
    "elType": "widget",
    "widgetType": "text-editor",
    "title": "",
    "path": "7>5379a55>9b703bb>7828241",
    "texts": [
      [
        "editor",
        "<p>Repeated chemical use is not ideal. It can be harsh, may not reach the real obstruction and can make the work area less pleasant or safe to handle. If a drain is slow, smells bad or keeps backing up, a practical plumbing check is usually better than adding more chemicals.</p>"
      ],
      [
        "text_color",
        "#545454"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
